@startuml state-task
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "JetBrains Mono"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam BorderColor #444444

title TaskState — Lifecycle Tâche — Apollia OS

[*] --> submitted : POST /api/v1/tasks\nou apollia-os run

submitted --> working : agent ACTIVE\nExecutionCoordinator dispatch

working --> completed : AIPResult.completed()
working --> failed : AIPResult.failed()\nou erreur non-récupérable
working --> input_required : agent attend input\nHITL
working --> canceled : DELETE /api/v1/tasks/{id}\nou timeout

input_required --> working : input fourni

completed --> [*]
failed --> [*]
canceled --> [*]

note right of submitted
  Rejeté si agent :
  - INITIALIZING → SubmitError::NotReady
  - STOPPING/STOPPED → SubmitError::Unavailable
  - DEGRADED → accepté avec warning
end note

note right of working
  StepBudget surveillé en continu.
  BudgetExceeded → failed.
  ResilienceLayer actif.
end note

@enduml
